Search
Indeed Indonesia job search — read from the SERP's own hydration blob, never its markup. Tier: clearance ticket (rung 8). Measured 2026-09-02 from the BE: cold solve 12.4s, then

Parameters
Name	Type	In	Description
query	string	query	Free-text search across job titles, companies and descriptions. Required unless a location is given.
location	string	query	City, province or the literal value Remote for work-from-anywhere roles. Required unless a query is given.
radius	number	query	Kilometres around the location. 0 keeps the exact city only.
days	number	query	Only jobs posted within this many days.
employmentType	enum	query	Contract shape of the role. One of fulltime, parttime, contract, internship, temporary, permanent.
sort	enum	query	Result order. Default relevance. One of relevance, date.
limit	number	query	Jobs to return. Default 20, max 50 — the upstream serves one window only.

