  Glints
Glints job board — keyword search plus a paged browse over its full listing set, with education, work-arrangement and experience filters.

Search
Glints job search. Our direct egress gets a 1.37MB "Glints - Firewall" page; the same URL through the clearance ticket answers 200 with `firewall: false`, so this runs on solvedFetch.

Parameters
Name	Type	In	Description
query	string	query	Free-text search across job titles.
country	string	query	Two-letter country code, e.g. ID, SG, VN, MY, TW.
locationId	string	query	Glints hierarchical location id from the filters endpoint.
jobType	enum	query	Employment type. One of FULL_TIME, PART_TIME, CONTRACT, INTERNSHIP, PROJECT_BASED.
workArrangement	enum	query	Where the work happens. One of ONSITE, HYBRID, REMOTE.
educationLevel	enum	query	Minimum education asked for. One of PRIMARY_SCHOOL, SECONDARY_SCHOOL, HIGH_SCHOOL, DIPLOMA, COLLEGE_DEGREE, BACHELOR_DEGREE, MASTER_DEGREE, PROFESSIONAL_EDUCATION.
experience	enum	query	Years-of-experience bracket. One of NO_EXPERIENCE, FRESH_GRAD, LESS_THAN_A_YEAR, ONE_TO_THREE_YEARS, THREE_TO_FIVE_YEARS, FIVE_TO_TEN_YEARS, MORE_THAN_TEN_YEARS.
postedWithin	enum	query	How recently the listing was updated. One of PAST_24_HOURS, PAST_WEEK, PAST_MONTH, ANY_TIME.
minSalary	number	query	Minimum salary; requires `currency`.
currency	enum	query	Currency for `minSalary`. One of IDR, SGD, VND, JPY, MYR.
sort	enum	query	Result order. Default relevance. One of relevance, latest.

