  Dealls
Dealls job board — search by sector, employment type, city, company and salary band, with skills and company detail per job.

Search
Dealls job search — open JSON API, rung 1 (direct) per recon, 90-600ms. Upstream: api.sejutacita.id/v1/explore-job/job, envelope {data:{docs,totalDocs,totalPages,page},code}.

Parameters
Name	Type	In	Description
query	string	query	Free-text search across job titles.
city	number	query	City id, as returned in `location.cityId`.
company	string	query	Company id, as returned in `company.id`.
sector	string	query	Company sector, spelled as `company.industry` returns it.
benefit	string	query	Company benefit, spelled as `company.benefits` returns it.
employmentType	enum	query	Employment type. One of fullTime, partTime, internship, contract, freelance, projectBased, volunteer, temporary.
workArrangement	enum	query	Where the role is worked from. One of onSite, hybrid, remote.
educationLevel	number	query	Dealls' numeric education-level code, as returned in `candidatePreference.educationLevelCodes`.
highSalary	enum	query	Only roles paying above 30 million IDR. One of true, false.
status	enum	query	Posting status. Default active. One of active, paused.
sort	enum	query	Sort key. Default mostRelevant. One of mostRelevant, createdAt, updatedAt, mostRecentAndLeastApplicant, highestSalary, publishedAt.
sortDirection	enum	query	Sort direction. Default desc. One of asc, desc.
page	number	query	Page number. Default 1.
limit	number	query	Results per page. Default 20, max 50.

